messages:
taylor: Quick sync  I opened PR 3022 with banner copy + migration checklist. Need a tiny SDK example and an embed fallback snippet before we merge. https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/3022 :eyes:

pressley: Link received. Ops prefers path-level 301s for cache friendliness. What's the timeline?

taylor: Proposed cadence: 14-day soft banner -> 5-day prominent banner -> 48h 5% canary -> 2-day full redirect. Legal ok'd the 14-day notice.

omar: Two asks: (1) include the exact error string so support can grep, (2) add a Go example (we've not had that in the docs yet).

taylor: Error string I plan to include: "Error: 410 DeprecatedEndpoint: endpoint removed, upgrade to client v2"

omar: I'll draft a minimal Go snippet showing error handling and a JS snippet showing the new header routing. Put these in the PR and mark as examples only.

omar: Go SDK snippet:

```go
// go SDK v1 -> v2 error handling
resp, err := client.Call(ctx, req)
if err != nil {
    if strings.Contains(err.Error(), "DeprecatedEndpoint") {
        // show upgrade guidance
    }
}
```

omar: JS header example:

```js
// route via header so proxies can split v1/v2
const res = await client.call({
  headers: { 'X-Redwood-Client': 'v2' },
  input: '...'
})
```

pressley: Nice. Also include an embed fallback example that pads from 1024 -> 1536 dims. Keep the helper tiny. CI should run a snippet smoke test that asserts vector length.

docs-bot: Please add labels `migration`, `deprecation`, `needs-smoke`. CI will run snippet lint and the example tests on push. :robot_face:

taylor: I'll add the Go/JS examples, the exact error string, and a short embed pad helper to PR 3022. Target merge: Wednesday EOD. If anything blocks, ping @infra.

infra-bot: Ops note: schedule canary with infra at least 24h before full redirect. Provide rollback flag in the redirect map.

pressley: I'll review once the snippets are pushed. If others want to volunteer to write the quick support blurb, shout here. :thumbsup:
